  "body": "<p>On Friday October 21, as part of TIDE’s 25th Anniversary Celebrations, TIDE engaged youth clubs and schools under the theme “A Challenge to Reimagine Conservation” with an exhibition competition in Punta Gorda. Each participating group showcased their work and the theme within their booths, which were interactive and demonstrated a high level of preparation. Judges awarded:</p>\n<p>1st Place = Little Flower RC</p>\n<p>2nd Place = Jacinto ROOTS</p>\n<p>Joint 3rd Place = Changing TIDE’s of PG and Big <a></a>Falls Eco-Warriors</p>\n<p>We would like to thank the Ya’axche Conservation Trust team for their participation as judges and for supporting our initiative and educating young minds with their work in conservation at their booth. We also thank the students, staff and management of Toledo Community College for taking the time to be informed at our 25th Anniversary event. A special thanks to the management of Toledo Catholic Schools for supporting our work in Toledo. TIDE continues to engage the future leaders of Belize in conservation.</p>\n<div id=\"gallery-3\"><figure>\n<a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/DSC09863.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/DSC09863.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a>\n</figure><figure>\n<a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/DSC09710.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/DSC09710.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a>\n</figure><figure>\n<a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/DSC09813.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/DSC09813.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a>\n</figure><figure>\n<a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/DSC09763.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/DSC09763.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a>\n</figure><figure>\n<a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/DSC09691.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/DSC09691.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a>\n</figure><figure>\n<a href=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/DSC09744.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2022/10